{"id":"d9ebe5c8a3bc815c","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-langlands-tunnel.md","title":"Langlands Tunnel","display":"df-langlands-tunnel — Langlands Tunnel","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-langlands-tunnel","aliases":["58-df-langlands-tunnel"],"display":"df-langlands-tunnel — Langlands Tunnel","depends_on":["[[58-df-bijective]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-group]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-langlands-tunnel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-langlands-tunnel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-langlands-tunnel — Langlands Tunnel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K^\\times,W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}},m_K,m_W,\\operatorname{rec}_K\\in V\">\\(K^\\times,W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}},m_K,m_W,\\operatorname{rec}_K\\in V\\)</span> (multiplicative carriers, operations, and candidate reciprocity map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocalReciprocityIso}_S(\\operatorname{rec}_K;K^\\times,m_K,W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}},m_W)\">\\(\\mathrm{LocalReciprocityIso}_S(\\operatorname{rec}_K;K^\\times,m_K,W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}},m_W)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}tunnel} \\vdash \\mathrm{LocalReciprocityIso}_S(\\operatorname{rec}_K;K^\\times,m_K,W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}},m_W)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Group}_S(K^\\times,m_K)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}},m_W)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\operatorname{rec}_K,K^\\times,W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}})\\land\\forall x,y\\in K^\\times\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{rec}_K(m_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=m_W(\\langle\\operatorname{rec}_K(x),\\operatorname{rec}_K(y)\\rangle)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}tunnel} \\vdash \\mathrm{LocalReciprocityIso}_S(\\operatorname{rec}_K;K^\\times,m_K,W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}},m_W)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Group}_S(K^\\times,m_K)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}},m_W)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\operatorname{rec}_K,K^\\times,W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}})\\land\\forall x,y\\in K^\\times\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{rec}_K(m_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=m_W(\\langle\\operatorname{rec}_K(x),\\operatorname{rec}_K(y)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The historical “tunnel” label is retained only as an explicit group-isomorphism predicate; both group laws and the declared map <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rec}_K\">\\(\\operatorname{rec}_K\\)</span> are now tied to the assertion.</li>\n<li>Local Artin: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}} \\cong K^\\times\">\\(W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}} \\cong K^\\times\\)</span> via local class field theory.</li>\n<li>Global Artin: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}} \\cong \\mathbb{A}_K^\\times / K^\\times \\overline{N(\\mathbb{A}_K^\\times)}\">\\(W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}} \\cong \\mathbb{A}_K^\\times / K^\\times \\overline{N(\\mathbb{A}_K^\\times)}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Non-abelian: functoriality between <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-groups.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S$, $\\mathrm{Function}$, and $\\mathrm{Bijective}$ (see [[58-df-group]], [[58-df-function]], and [[58-df-bijective]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S$, $\\mathrm{Function}$, and $\\mathrm{Bijective}$ (see [[58-df-group]], [[58-df-function]], and [[58-df-bijective]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S$, $\\mathrm{Function}$, and $\\mathrm{Bijective}$ (see [[58-df-group]], [[58-df-function]], and [[58-df-bijective]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K^\\times,W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}},m_K,m_W,\\operatorname{rec}_K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocalReciprocityIso}_S(\\operatorname{rec}_K;K^\\times,m_K,W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}},m_W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}tunnel} \\vdash \\mathrm{LocalReciprocityIso}_S(\\operatorname{rec}_K;K^\\times,m_K,W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}},m_W)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Group}_S(K^\\times,m_K)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}},m_W)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\operatorname{rec}_K,K^\\times,W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}})\\land\\forall x,y\\in K^\\times\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{rec}_K(m_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=m_W(\\langle\\operatorname{rec}_K(x),\\operatorname{rec}_K(y)\\rangle)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rec}_K","display":false},{"tex":"W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}} \\cong K^\\times","display":false},{"tex":"W_K^{\\mathrm{ab}} \\cong \\mathbb{A}_K^\\times / K^\\times \\overline{N(\\mathbb{A}_K^\\times)}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1624,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-756","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-langlands-tunnel.md|58-df-langlands-tunnel]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["d583890235faf0d5","36d7463d215be751","ed71f39f59370734"]}